      "writtenOn": "2026-02-16T18:01:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We don\u0027t have this caching present in any of the other providers\n\nSee `fetchProjects` and `fetchGroups`.\n\nhttps://cs.opensource.google/gerrit/gerrit/gerrit/+/master:polygerrit-ui/app/elements/core/gr-smart-search/gr-smart-search.ts;l\u003d177?q\u003d%22fetchGroups(%22\u0026sq\u003d\n\nI also saw this AI generated comment(nice job AI review) but I prefer to add this to all providers in a follow up CL if we decide to add it.",
      "parentUuid": "e65058ec_7b2e1092",
      "revId": "845012a3303264989d6b1a4c5f6cb6e946db9327",
